{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an early demo of the DEFICIT project in development. It comprises a roughly 1-hour section of the game, in which you will be introduced to a selection of characters and enemies housed in the stifling warrens of Hadrian's Wall. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo showcases an array of scavenged DIY weaponry, 3D-printed firearms and other creatively lethal tools. The features described below are <strong>all</strong> included and recorded in the demo build. Save data will not be carried over to the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a selection of pre-alpha gameplay, environments, tools, weapons and enemies, woven together with a contiguous snapshot of the story that drives your quest through the mechanical tribulations of Hadrian's Wall.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411550/extras/DEFICIT_SteamSubtitles_Steal.png?t=1748524513\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411550/extras/TrailerJan2025_STEAL.gif?t=1748524513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Designation:</strong> [Carrie]. <strong>Location:</strong> [Project Sidereal].\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Assignment:</strong>\u00a0In this demo of DEFICIT, under the instruction of your shady benefactor known only as <strong>[The Client]</strong>, you must steal the <strong>[Interpolator]</strong> and use it to escape the sprawling research labs of Project Sidereal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411550/extras/DEFICIT_SteamSubtitles_Fight.png?t=1748524513\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411550/extras/TrailerJan2025_FIGHT.gif?t=1748524513\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Project Sidereal</strong> is housed within <strong>Hadrian's Wall</strong>, a maze of concrete warrens and liminal installations policed by the seasoned officers of the <strong>Oversight Taskforce</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo you can sneak past them, turn their defensive systems against them or take them head-on: the best path through the manifold dangers of Project Sidereal is yours to choose.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3411550?t=1748524513","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411550/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748524513","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411550/6add30727b2c0caeb3031473fe03c887a5ef6465/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748524513","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411550/6add30727b2c0caeb3031473fe03c887a5ef6465/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748524513","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"DEFICIT includes many melee-focused fight scenes in which scavenged weapons (Bricks, Pipes etc.) are used, along with firearms."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an early demo of the DEFICIT project in development. It comprises a roughly 1-hour section of the game, in which you will be introduced to a selection of characters and enemies housed in the stifling warrens of Hadrian's Wall. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo showcases an array of scavenged DIY weaponry, 3D-printed firearms and other creatively lethal tools. The features described below are <strong>all</strong> included and recorded in the demo build. Save 